        "version":  "1.3.3",
        "description":  "\u003ch3\u003eThis version will only work with SPT 3.7.1, 3.7.2, 3.7.3\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLocked doors are now usable by bots once they’re unlocked\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLocked doors now properly cut the navmesh once unlocked and opened\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUpdated Streets navmesh:\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLexos mines now properly blocked off, no more suicide bots\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUpper area of Lexos accessible to bots again\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEscalator in new mall can be used by bots\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDoors outside the usual AI cell coverage should now be usable by bots\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSwitch to 7-zip archives for releases\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n",
